    CliCommandRunner::run's e.kind() == ErrorKind::NotFound check in
    callisto-cli/src/runner.rs. The string heuristic (classify_host_failure/
    looks_like_not_found) stays in place -- runner_pdk.rs's wasm/pdk path
    still needs it, since warpgate_pdk errors carry no ErrorKind.

    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED

